    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23445" root="شيأ" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِيْئَةٌ</span></b>  [<i>Will, wish,</i> or <i>desire,</i>] a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَآءَهُ</span>,
(Lh, K,) [and] so is ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشِيْئَةٌ</span></b>  [which is mentioned
in the K as an inf. n.]. (Msb.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُلُّ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَىْءٍ بِشِيْئَةِ ٱللّٰهِ</span>, (S, K,) i. e. ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَمِشِيْئَتِهِ</span></b>  [<i>Everything
is by the will of God</i>]. (S.)

